## Design Notes

- Clean. Minimal. No stock photos.
- Dark or light background. Pick one. Commit.
- Paul's LinkedIn photo on the Home page.
- Mobile-first. Roofers check this on their phone between jobs.
- Fast. Under 2 seconds to load. No heavy animations.
- No chat widgets. No popups. No cookie banners.

---

## Content Rules

- Start every section with the business owner's problem.
- Write like Paul talks. Short. Direct. Fragments are fine.
- "You" throughout. Never "clients" or "businesses" in third person.
- No em dashes. No semicolons. No colons in body copy.
- No buzzwords. If the word appears in a LinkedIn influencer post, do not use it.
- No "I am passionate about." No "results-driven." No "streamline."
- Read every line out loud. If it sounds like a website, rewrite it until it sounds like a person.
- No emojis.